<panel_attributes>title=sd UC-04 Basic Course - 블록 밀기
desc=플레이어가 블록 쪽으로 입력하면 블록과 플레이어가 한 칸씩 움직인다. 구멍이면 블록과 구멍이 함께 사라진다.\nAlternate: 2a 뒤 칸이 벽·블록·격자 밖 - step() 이 null, 상태와 이동 횟수 불변
obj=사용자~u ACTOR EXECUTION
obj=&lt;&lt;UI&gt;&gt;\n_:PlayScreen_~ps
obj=&lt;&lt;UI&gt;&gt;\n_:Camera_~cam
obj=&lt;&lt;entity&gt;&gt;\n_:Session_~se
obj=&lt;&lt;utility&gt;&gt;\nEngine~en
obj=&lt;&lt;entity&gt;&gt;\n_:Level_~lv
obj=&lt;&lt;entity&gt;&gt;\n_:GameState_~gs

u-&gt;&gt;&gt;ps : 1: 블록 방향 입력: keyPressed(e)
ps-&gt;&gt;&gt;cam : 2: d = mapKey(key)
ps-&gt;&gt;&gt;se : 3: r = move(d)
se-&gt;&gt;&gt;en : 4: r = step(level, state, d)
en-&gt;&gt;&gt;lv : 5: to = neighbor(from, dir)
en-&gt;&gt;&gt;gs : 6: hasBlock(to)
en-&gt;&gt;&gt;lv : 7: behind = neighbor(to, dir)
en-&gt;&gt;&gt;gs : 8: hasBlock(behind)
en-&gt;&gt;&gt;lv : 9: t = tile(behind)
en-&gt;&gt;&gt;gs : 10: [t == HOLE] next = withFill(to, to, behind)
en-&gt;&gt;&gt;gs : 11: [그 외] next = withPush(to, to, behind)
en-&gt;&gt;&gt;en + : 12: isCleared(lv, next)
tick=
se-&gt;&gt;&gt;se + : 13: undoStack.push(state), state = r.state()
tick=
ps-&gt;&gt;&gt;ps + : 14: animStep = r (블록 이동 / 소멸 애니메이션)
tick=</panel_attributes>
